    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards to build the ultimate deck and obliterate monsters!! A deck-building roguelike FPS where you fight with a bizarre right hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed cards to your hand!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By feeding cards to your right hand, it can transform into a gun or unleash special effects. Master your cards and fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/a907cdbe2a9f1b39a136d97bca63e656.poster.avif?t=1749890189\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/a907cdbe2a9f1b39a136d97bca63e656.webm?t=1749890189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/a907cdbe2a9f1b39a136d97bca63e656.mp4?t=1749890189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blast away monsters!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate monsters by firing bullets or launching bombs with your transformed right hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/e221ccc49fabb134dcfe2af251169066.poster.avif?t=1749890189\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/e221ccc49fabb134dcfe2af251169066.webm?t=1749890189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787450/extras/e221ccc49fabb134dcfe2af251169066.mp4?t=1749890189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the ultimate deck!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain cards by defeating enemies or visiting shops. Combine cards to construct your very own unique deck!</p>",
